00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:16.483 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MORE THAN A DOZEN COUNTRIES,

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:18.651 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INCLUDING THE U.S., UK, CANADA,

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:19.786 size:53% position:73% line:0%
JAPAN, AUSTRALIA, ISSUED A

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.488 size:53% position:73% line:0%
JOINT STATEMENT RAISING CONCERN

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.855 size:53% position:73% line:0%
