IT SAYS IT WAS MOST LIKELY IT

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:29.829 size:53% position:73% line:0%
JUMPED FROM AN ANIMAL, PROBABLY

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.465 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BACK TO HUMAN.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.767 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE DIRECTOR GENERAL OF THE

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.735 size:53% position:73% line:0%
W.H.O. SAYS HE DOES NOT AGREE

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:37.771 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WITH THE FINDING THAT THE VIRUS,

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:40.507 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHICH LEAKED FROM A LAB ORATORY,

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.774 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WAS RESEARCHED EXTENSIVELY

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.509 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ENOUGH.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.776 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HE SAYS FURTHER STUDY IS

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:46.479 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NEEDED.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:47.747 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PART OF THE W.H.O. TEAM WHO

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:49.582 size:53% position:73% line:0%
TRAVELED TO CHINA IS HERE.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:50.617 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THANK YOU FOR BEING WITH US.

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:51.284 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WE APPRECIATE IT.

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:51.551 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING, FOR ME,

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:56.122 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ANYWAYS.

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:58.925 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THERE SEEMS TO BE AGREEMENT

00:00:56.289 --> 00:01:01.061 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AMONG MANY COUNTRIES THAT THE

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:03.963 size:53% position:73% line:0%
W.H.O., IN MANY WAYS, WAS HAD.

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:05.098 size:53% position:73% line:0%
I WANT YOU TO LISTEN TO THE

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.133 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SENIOR WHITE HOUSE ADVISER,

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.467 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ANDY SLAVITT, ON TUESDAY.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.969 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HERE HE HAS.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:11.771 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TO UNDERSTAND THE

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:12.172 size:53% position:73% line:0%
METHODOLOGY OF THE REPORT

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:15.008 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BETTER.

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:16.943 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHERE THE INVESTIGATORS WHO

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.210 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WROTE THE REPORT GIVEN COMPLETE

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.146 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ACCESS?

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:22.048 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WERE THEY IN ANY WAY INFLUENCED

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.083 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BY THE GOVERNMENT IN CHINA WHEN

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:24.117 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THEY WROTE THIS REPORT?

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:26.019 size:53% position:73% line:0%
UNTIL WE KNOW THE ANSWERS TO

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:27.921 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THOSE QUESTIONS, I THINK IT'S

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:30.256 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BEST THAT WE VIEW THE REPORT

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:32.058 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WITH HEALTHY SKEPTICISM.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.961 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WOULD YOU LIKE TO ANSWER

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:35.295 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THOSE QUESTIONS ANDY SLAVITT

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:38.098 size:53% position:73% line:0%
JUST POSED?

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:40.166 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; I THINK SKEPTICISM AND HIS

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:42.936 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OPINION WAS ALREADY CIRCULATING

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:43.136 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BEFORE THE REPORT EVER CAME

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.905 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OUT.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:48.908 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT'S A CONCERN FROM A GROUP

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:52.011 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT FEELS THE VIRUS CAME FROM

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:52.378 size:53% position:73% line:0%
A LAB HAND THAT IT NEEDS TO BE

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:56.950 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INVESTIGATED.

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:59.919 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHAT WE DID WITH OUR CHINESE

00:01:57.117 --> 00:02:01.921 size:53% position:73% line:0%
COLLEAGUES TO COLLECT, DISCUSS,

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:03.156 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AGGREGATE, ANALYZE ALL THE

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:05.925 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INFORMATION THAT'S AVAILABLE

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:08.962 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BASED ON A LONG LIST OF STUDIES

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:10.230 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT WERE DONE, AND THAT'S NOT

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.131 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AN INSPECTION.

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.232 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT'S NOT AN AUDIT.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.934 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT'S A JOINT STUDY.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:16.903 size:53% position:73% line:0%
I THINK THERE IS

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:18.972 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MISUNDERSTANDING ABOUT HOW THIS

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:21.174 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WAS SET UP.

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:22.275 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DID WE DISCUSS THE POSSIBILITY

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:25.078 size:53% position:73% line:0%
