00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:26.913 size:53% position:73% line:0%
YES, WE DID, WITH ALL THE LABS

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:27.947 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT WERE INVOLVED IN THE EARLY

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:32.152 size:53% position:73% line:0%
RESPONSE.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:34.921 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WE VISITED THEM AND DISCUSS THE

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:37.090 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SECURITY AND THE PROGRAMS OF

00:02:35.088 --> 00:02:39.092 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WORK, THE TRAINING OF THE STAFF,

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:43.930 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE TESTING OF THE STAFF, AND

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:47.967 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WE DID NOT FIND ANY INDICATION

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:52.906 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OR NEED FOR FURTHER FOLLOW-UP.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:55.942 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHAT WE DO SAY, OF COURSE, IS

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:58.745 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IF THERE ARE THESE ACCUSATIONS,

00:02:56.109 --> 00:03:00.947 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT WOULD BE GOOD IF THERE IS

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:01.214 size:53% position:73% line:0%
REAL EVIDENCE TO SHARE WITH THE

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:04.117 size:53% position:73% line:0%
W.H.O..

00:03:02.782 --> 00:03:08.154 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; ON THE ISSUE OF THE STAFF AT

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:10.890 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE LAB IN WUHAN, THROUGHOUT

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:13.927 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NOT JUST THIS PARTICULAR GLOBAL

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:15.962 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PANDEMIC, BUT FOR GENERATIONS,

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:18.932 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DECADES, CHINA HAS A HISTORY OF

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:20.900 size:53% position:73% line:0%
COVERING UP, LYING, OBFUSCATING,

00:03:19.098 --> 00:03:22.068 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AND BEING LESS THAN TRANSPARENT

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:24.070 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AND NOT TELLING THE TRUTH.

00:03:22.802 --> 00:03:25.238 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHY WERE THEY GIVEN THE BENEFIT

00:03:24.237 --> 00:03:26.105 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OF THE DOUBT ON THE SITUATION

00:03:25.805 --> 00:03:27.974 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IN THE LAB?

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.208 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHY ARE WE TAKING THEM AT THEIR

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:31.244 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WORD?

00:03:29.309 --> 00:03:33.947 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE WERE DISCUSSING ALL OF

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:38.051 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THIS, AND LIKE WE DO WITH

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:41.921 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SCIENTIFIC COLLEAGUES, THIS IS

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:43.957 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HOW WE APPROACHED THIS WITH

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:56.769 size:53% position:73% line:0%
JOINT STUDIES AMONG SCIENTISTS.

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:57.170 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WE SCRUTINIZE THEM AND THEN SAY

00:03:56.936 --> 00:04:03.209 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THE CONCLUSIONS.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:06.212 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IF YOU SAY, BUT I DON'T BELIEVE

00:04:03.376 --> 00:04:06.546 size:53% position:73% line:0%
YOU, THEN THAT ENDS ALL

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:12.051 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DISCUSSION.

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:12.318 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AGAIN, THAT'S NOT HOW THIS WAS

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:14.020 size:53% position:73% line:0%
STAFFED.

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:14.320 size:53% position:73% line:0%
YOU NEED AN INSPECTION OR

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:17.123 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SOMETHING.

00:04:14.887 --> 00:04:19.325 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHAT IN THIS REPORT CAN YOU

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:22.028 size:53% position:73% line:0%
POINT TO AS SOME KIND OF NEW

00:04:19.492 --> 00:04:23.062 size:53% position:73% line:0%
PIECE OF EVIDENCE, NEW

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:25.031 size:53% position:73% line:0%
REVELATION, SOME KIND OF

00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:25.398 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BREAKTHROUGH IN THIS

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:28.101 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INVESTIGATION?

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:30.169 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHAT DID YOU ACTUALLY GET BY

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:32.272 size:53% position:73% line:0%
GOING THERE TO CHINA THAT WAS

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:33.206 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WORTH RISKING THE CREDIBILITY

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:34.307 size:53% position:73% line:0%
OF THE W.H.O.?

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:34.540 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT SEEMS TO BE WHAT HAPPENED

00:04:34.474 --> 00:04:41.047 size:53% position:73% line:0%
HERE.

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:41.514 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WHAT WAS THE RESULT THAT WE

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:46.319 size:53% position:73% line:0%
DIDN'T KNOW BEFORE?

00:04:41.848 --> 00:04:50.023 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHAT WE GOT, FOR PEOPLE THAT

00:04:46.486 --> 00:04:54.027 size:53% position:73% line:0%
READ THE REPORT, THEY WILL SEE

00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:58.031 size:53% position:73% line:0%
8 SEPARATE STUDIES WITH

00:04:54.193 --> 00:05:02.035 size:53% position:73% line:0%
EXTENSIVE NEW DATA COLLECTION

00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:04.170 size:53% position:73% line:0%
ON SURVEILLANCE DATA, MAKING

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:07.040 size:53% position:73% line:0%
MORTALITY, AND ANALYSIS GOING

00:05:04.337 --> 00:05:10.009 size:53% position:73% line:0%
