00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:39.005 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; TO BOIL THAT DOWN, YOU ARE

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:40.306 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SAYING WHAT WE DID LEARN IS

00:05:39.238 --> 00:05:42.308 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THAT WE CAN DEFINITIVELY SAY

00:05:40.473 --> 00:05:42.575 size:53% position:73% line:0%
THIS BEGAN IN DECEMBER AND NOT

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:43.443 size:53% position:73% line:0%
BEFORE?

00:05:43.042 --> 00:05:49.716 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; NOT WIDESPREAD.

00:05:47.447 --> 00:05:50.983 size:53% position:73% line:0%
IT'S VERY DIFFICULT TO FIND A

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:55.788 size:53% position:73% line:0%
SMALL CLUSTER, WHICH IS THE

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:57.724 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NEXT STEP, AND WE DISCUSSED

00:05:55.955 --> 00:06:00.660 size:53% position:73% line:0%
WITH SMALL BANKS IN HUBEI AND

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:02.595 size:53% position:73% line:0%
