00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:10.069 size:53% position:73% line:0%
FURTHER STUDIES.

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:12.872 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; WHAT'S THE REASON?

00:06:10.737 --> 00:06:15.041 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; YOU REALLY NEED THE FIRST

00:06:13.039 --> 00:06:20.680 size:53% position:73% line:0%
POSSIBLE CASES FOR INTERVIEWS

00:06:15.541 --> 00:06:21.080 size:53% position:73% line:0%
TO GET CLUES ON THE REALLY,

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:23.716 size:53% position:73% line:0%
EARLIEST STEPS.

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:25.918 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; QUICKLY, WAS THAT

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:27.887 size:53% position:73% line:0%
INFORMATION WORTH THE BATTERING

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:28.888 size:53% position:73% line:0%
TO ITS REPUTATION THE W.H.O. IS

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:31.657 size:53% position:73% line:0%
NOW TAKING?

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:32.759 size:53% position:73% line:0%
&gt;&gt; THE BATTERING IS NOT FROM

00:06:31.824 --> 00:06:35.728 size:53% position:73% line:0%
