00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:55.948 size:53% position:73% line:0%
EMERGENCIES CAN HAPPEN ANYWHERE

00:06:53.846 --> 00:06:55.948 size:53% position:73% line:0%
AND IT'S GOOD TO DIG DO

